	(text "U601: ENA=3.3 V, INA=HEATER_EN. Channel B disabled. VDD from local +5V_GATE.\nC601/C602 close to VDD/GND. Short OUTA-G-S-GND loop.\nMCU R210=10k pull-down; R602 discharges the gate when unpowered.\nVerify 5 V startup/droop: SOIC start threshold up to 4.65 V; never power directly from 12 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0239c72d-4d5d-5a05-a140-27900a5edf6a")
	)
	(text "PTC: низкочастотное ON/OFF. Внешний термостат/термопредохранитель\nпоследовательно с +PTC, с DC-рейтингом по току; температуру выбрать\nпо механике нагревателя. На этой схеме он НЕ установлен.\nTVS — от выбросов на проводах, не защита от КЗ. Предохранитель ещё нужен."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 175.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4dbbc201-19dd-5f83-b070-097451d8c59e")
	)
	(text "PTC / 12 V / 100 W / 8.33 A, ПУСК ~9.58 A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "82bb9dd5-212e-5170-a51a-f347edc95d74")
	)
	(text "Q601: G=4, S=1/2/3, D=5; SO-8FL exposed drain is not GND.\nRDS(on) max 3.3 mOhm at VGS=4.5 V, Tj=25 C.\nConduction ~0.229 W at 8.33 A / ~0.303 W at 9.58 A.\nHot resistance and switching overshoot still require thermal/scope checks."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 151.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.05 1.05)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b265a6f5-dfce-5b57-8983-a5f2e930067d")
	)
	(text "0.13 DRAFT: power/thermal limits remain subject to prototype validation."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c2aa5ada-8f3c-5716-9467-86d1bb049840")
	)
